ts azd as N/A for toolbox and version list, get and delete, yet azd ai toolbox list, show,\nversions list, delete and publish exist. For Foundry Toolkit it says version list/get/delete = No (the UI shows the\nlatest version only) and guardrails = yes, while the prose says guardrail configuration is not yet available in the VS\nCode extension.","textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"originalText":"Learn's feature table lists azd as N/A for toolbox and version list, get and delete, yet azd ai toolbox list, show,\nversions list, delete and publish exist. For Foundry Toolkit it says version list/get/delete = No (the UI shows the\nlatest version only) and guardrails = yes, while the prose says guardrail configuration is not yet available in the VS\nCode extension.","autoResize":true,"lineHeight":1.25},{"id":"oek8UzEIybVjUNkmYHMAJ","type":"text","x":42.0,"y":5430.75,"width":210.5,"height":15.0,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#1971c2","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"groupIds":["X30VPBlD64k12-HTsvXAK"],"frameId":null,"index":"bCV","roundness":null,"seed":1050705990,"version":2,"versionNonce":614789920,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":null,"updated":1793750400000,"link":"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/foundry/agents/how-to/tools/toolbox","locked":false,"fontSize":12,"fontFamily":5,"text":"Learn: Create and manage a toolbox","textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"originalText":"Learn: Create and manage a toolbox","autoResize":true,"lineHeight":1.25},{"id":"Mr9T7JhfxnVrCBS5Jqbhg","type":"rectangle","x":0.0,"y":5469.75,"width":968.0,"height":357.5,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#e8590c","backgroundColor":"#f8f9fa","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"groupIds":["rjOkoHhviPpGXGlG_YPuI"],"frameId":null,"index":"bCW","roundness":{"type":3},"seed":426313015,"version":2,"versionNonce":552444370,"isDeleted":f